{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國政治新聞網站Politico 10月10日報道，自6月至今，至少12名獲准在美國生活和工作的港人，被特朗普政府的移民執法部門強迫簽署自願離境協議，而他們在美的合法身分可能於明年2月屆滿，屆時或會被驅逐出境。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T04:58:00.121231+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T04:13:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T18:57:37.665695+00:00","content_updated_at":null,"content_hash":"c665852472bb61cc3da188fd2e4c5f269fc0054abd68f523dfca5dee282b2b31","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}